From contact@home56.top Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 5656565566 <contact@home56.top>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 23:20:24 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] sepolicy: label the read-only Floral FUSE view verifier
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Confine the read-only view verifier and label mountinfo and osrelease
with the existing proc_mounts and proc_version types. Grant read_policy
without granting broad proc access or changing Android neverallow rules.
Mirror the component policy and labels into the API 31/32 snapshots.

Requires the existing patches through 0008. No private uevent transport
or additional socket permission is introduced.

Base-tree: 2ba190005fb056fcf8c5a613e3fa080705d08762
Result-tree: 904f6eeb955b4c875757cdb688f466eb6c9b83c4
